21202313610'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/michael-thomas-slager-vocational.html?showComment=1428614427985#c5142426621202313610' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/michael-thomas-slager-vocational.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3643821376503332788' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3643821376503332788' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-592024275"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 9, 2015 at 3:20 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3243861984330412042</id><published>2015-04-09T14:06:32.782-06:00</published><updated>2015-04-09T14:06:32.782-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;The same result would have been achieved in ...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;The same result would have been achieved in the murder of Walter Scott were it not for the presence of a young man equipped with a cellphone and armed with exceptional courage and presence of mind...&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;...who had better go into hiding if he has any sense. Just because Slager has been thrown under the bus by the system, does not mean they will look with fond eyes on the person who forced them to do so.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3643821376503332788/comments/default/3243861984330412042'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3643821376503332788/comments/default/3243861984330412042'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/michael-thomas-slager-vocational.html?showComment=1428609992782#c3243861984330412042' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/michael-thomas-slager-vocational.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3643821376503332788' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3643821376503332788' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-954798999"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 9, 2015 at 2:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4916954013270107488</id><published>2015-04-09T13:12:44.044-06:00</published><updated>2015-04-09T13:12:44.044-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr Griggs,cops and cop&amp;#39;s families and employin...</title><content type='html'>Mr Griggs,cops and cop&amp;#39;s families and employing agencies are going to be surprised when cops start suddenly dropping like flys and no one willing to stop and render assistance or first aide...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3643821376503332788/comments/default/4916954013270107488'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3643821376503332788/comments/default/4916954013270107488'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/michael-thomas-slager-vocational.html?showComment=1428606764044#c4916954013270107488' title=''/><author><name>Cederq</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05603951063463035196</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='21' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-lRGqoUjQZ